thermo 1000

# --- Trajectory ---
dump dump_npt all custom 1000 npt_final.dump id type mol x y z ix iy iz vx vy vz
dump_modify dump_npt append yes

# --- Restart Checkpointing ---
restart 10000 npt_1.rst npt_2.rst

# --- Initial Velocities (optional) ---
# Velocities read from data file

# --- SHAKE Constraints ---
# SHAKE disabled (TraPPE-UA united-atom)

# --- NPT Thermostat + Barostat (Nose-Hoover) ---
